  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The events of the Risk Incident Sharing and Coordination profile as typed payloads with their registered event type identifiers: credential compromise, account disabling, enabling and deletion, identifier change and recycling, opt-out and account recovery. Registered over the Security Events core in one call; the same models serve a Shared Signals transmitter and receiver, which is how an identity provider tells a relying party that an account was taken over. Full details: https://github.com/Abblix/Oidc.Server/releases/tag/v2.4",
